Usage: pptx [options] [command]

Official CLI for pptx.dev — generate, parse, validate, and render OPF
presentations.

Options:
  -V, --version               output the version number
  --api-key <key>             Override the API key for this call
  --base-url <url>            Override the API base URL
  -h, --help                  display help for command

Commands:
  login [options]             Save a pptx.dev API key to ~/.pptx/config.json
                              (0600)
  logout                      Remove saved pptx.dev credentials
  generate [options] <input>  Generate a presentation from an OPF JSON file or
                              a prompt
  validate [options] <file>   Validate an OPF JSON document against the
                              canonical schema
  parse [options] <file>      Parse a .pptx file into OPF JSON via the pptx.dev
                              API
  render [options] <file>     Render an OPF JSON document to a target format
  fmt [options] <file>        Format/normalize an OPF JSON document (local, no
                              API call)
  add [options] <component>   Scaffold OPF component snippets (slide types,
                              themes)
  help [command]              display help for command
